+## Failed session setup
+
+If `beforeSession` throws an `Error`, the caller receives that same error after `onError` receives the session and error and `afterSession` receives the session; no later turn hook has begun, but `beforeSession` may have completed only part of its setup, so `afterSession` must tolerate resources that were never allocated ([validated by: reports a failed beforeSession and runs afterSession before rejecting with the same error](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L9)).
